  "assumptions": [
   "Power target: about 215 per arm to detect 0.4 SD at 80% power (H1 MDE 0.3985 with n = 224/215 against the observed 0.638); powered for the main op-ed effect within each chat condition, with a wider margin than needed for the interaction. Total about 860 before attrition.",
   "Online US panel with quotas for anti-spending respondents; compensation set by the panel",
   "Chat content coded with a validated classifier checked against human coding, not keyword lists",
   "A one-week follow-up repeats the support and certainty items; it is run as a separate wave to the same respondents",
   "Four arms exceed the two-to-four limit only at the limit; the survey is about 10 minutes"
  ],
  "unresolved": [
   "Actual op-ed and placebo texts, chatbot configuration, classifier and validation sample must be supplied by the research team",
   "Follow-up wave survey instrument and recontact logistics",
   "IRB number and compensation"
